AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_86429> "A (1<i>E</i>)-1-(4-chlorophenyl)-4,4-dimethyl-2-(1<em>H</em>-1,2,4-triazol-1-yl)pent-1-en-3-ol that has <i>R</i> configuration at the chiral centre. It is the enantiomer of the fungicide and plant growth retardant uniconazole-P; the fungicide and plant growth retardant uniconazole is the racemic mixture comprising equimolar amounts of (<i>R</i>)-uniconazole and uniconazole-P.")
