AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_8988> "A member of the class of pyranoindolizinoquinolines that is (4<i>S</i>)-pyrano[3',4':6,7]indolizino[1,2-<em>b</em>]quinoline-3,14-dione bearing two additional ethyl substituents at positions 4 and 11 as well as two additional hydroxy substituents at positions 4 and 9. It is the active metabolite of irinotecan and is ~1000 times more active than irinotecan itself.")
